ading\" id=\"an-institutional-financial-services-firm\">An Institutional Financial Services Firm<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Founded in 2007, Penserra is an institutional financial services firm with offices located in New York, Chicago, Newport Beach, CA and the San Francisco Bay Area. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignright size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"612\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-1183921668-1024x612.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4556 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-1183921668-1024x612.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-1183921668-500x299.jpg 500w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-1183921668-768x459.jpg 768w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-1183921668-800x478.jpg 800w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-1183921668.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/612;\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p>Services include Global Equity Trading, Fixed Income Trading, Investment Banking, ETF Sub-Advising, Active Investment Management, and Equity Research. Penserra is a certified Minority-Owned Business Enterprise (MBE).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"a-focus-on-customer-service\">A Focus on Customer Service<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Penserra holds to the conviction that there is a different way for a financial services firm to create value. Powered by precision, innovation, and trust, Penserra strives to provide its clients superior service and exceptional results by:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Developing exceptional partnerships<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Challenging conventional thinking<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Working with relentless tenacity<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Acting with integrity, empathy, and conviction<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We are Penserra. We believe we can always do more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-nk-awb nk-awb alignfull nk-awb-2tXLWx\"><div class=\"nk-awb-wrap\" data-awb-type=\"image\" data-awb-parallax=\"scroll\" data-awb-parallax-speed=\"0.01\" data-awb-parallax-mobile=\"false\" data-awb-image-background-size=\"cover\" data-awb-image-background-position=\"50% 50%\"><div class=\"nk-awb-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/background-light-3.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-31 jarallax-img lazyload\" width=\"1798\" height=\"1428\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/background-light-3.jpg 1798w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/background-light-3-300x238.jpg 300w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/background-light-3-1024x813.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/background-light-3-768x610.jpg 768w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/background-light-3-1536x1220.jpg 1536w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1798px) 100vw, 1798px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1798px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1798\/1428;\" \/><\/div><\/div><div class=\"nk-awb-wrap-content is-layout-constrained wp-block-awb-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:32%\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"watch\">WATCH<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"george-madrigal-penserra-founder-and-ceo-on-what-makes-the-firm-unique\">George Madrigal, Penserra Founder and CEO, on what makes the firm unique<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:65%\">\n<div class=\"gosign-vimeo-video-player ratio-169\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"containerWraper lazyload\" style=\"background:inherit\" data-bg=\"url(https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/video-still-04.jpg) no-repeat center\/100% black\"><div class=\"videoContainer\" id=\"videoContainer1\"><\/div><div class=\"splashImageConatiner\" onclick=\"this.style.cssText='display:none';this.previousSibling.innerHTML= atob('PGlmcmFtZSAgc3JjPSdodHRwczovL3BsYXllci52aW1lby5jb20vdmlkZW8vNDg4NTgzNjYzP2F1dG9wbGF5PTEmcG9ydHJhaXQ9MCZ0aXRsZT0wJmJ5bGluZT0wJmRudD0xJyBmcmFtZUJvcmRlcj0nMCcgYWxsb3c9J2F1dG9wbGF5OyBmdWxsc2NyZWVuJyBhbGxvd0Z1bGxTY3JlZW4+PC9pZnJhbWU+');\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"playBtn\"><div class=\"play-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid\" tabindex=\"-1\"><polygon class=\"fill\" points=\"1,0 20,10 1,20\"><\/polygon><\/svg><\/div><\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote alignleft\"><blockquote><p>Penserra holds to the conviction that there is a different way for a financial services firm to create value.<\/p><\/blockquote><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"social-responsibility\">Social Responsibility<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>By engaging in socially responsible practices, having sound business ethics and making meaningful contributions, Penserra demonstrates to its employees, clients and the world around us that what matters most are relationships and values.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-nk-awb nk-awb alignfull nk-awb-Z6lIG4\"><div class=\"nk-awb-wrap\" data-awb-type=\"image\" data-awb-parallax=\"scroll\" data-awb-parallax-speed=\"0.01\" data-awb-parallax-mobile=\"false\" data-awb-image-background-size=\"cover\" data-awb-image-background-position=\"50% 50%\"><div class=\"nk-awb-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/background-light-mountains.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-4588 jarallax-img lazyload\" width=\"1250\" height=\"833\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/background-light-mountains.jpg 1250w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/background-light-mountains-500x333.jpg 500w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/background-light-mountains-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/background-light-mountains-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/background-light-mountains-800x533.jpg 800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1250px) 100vw, 1250px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1250px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1250\/833;\" \/><\/div><\/div><div class=\"nk-awb-wrap-content is-layout-constrained wp-block-awb-is-layout-constrained\">\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"><strong>pensar<\/strong>&nbsp;|&nbsp;pen-s\u00e4r | (Spanish)&nbsp;transitive verb:\n 1: to think,\n 2: to think about,\n 3: to intend, to plan on <\/pre>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-preformatted\"> <strong>tierra<\/strong>&nbsp;| ti-e-rra | (Spanish)&nbsp;noun:\n 1: earth\n 2: land\n 3: ground <\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p>The name Penserra is derived from the Spanish words \u201cpensar,\u201d which means \u201cto think,\u201d and \u201ctierra,\u201d which means \u201cearth\u201d or \u201cland.\u201d At Penserra, it is our mission to continuously examine and evaluate the ever-changing global financial markets to provide our clients with quality execution, local market intelligence, and exceptional service.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right cite\"><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"diversity-and-inclusion\">Diversity and Inclusion<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Penserra understands that diversity makes us stronger, and is <a href=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/values\/diversity-and-inclusion\/\">fully committed to an open, inclusive culture where differences are understood, respected, valued and supported throughout the firm<\/a>. <\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"sustainability-statement\">Sustainability Statement<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Penserra aspires to be a leader in corporate sustainability, and we are committed to the journey.&nbsp;By thinking and acting sustainably, we will position Penserra for a strong future.&nbsp;Sustainability is a business method that ensures responsibility in a manner that protects our employees, communities, stakeholders, and the environment, now and in the future.&nbsp; Our daily operations align business performance with a commitment to environmental, social, and community stewardship.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"minority-business-enterprise-mbe\">Minority Business Enterprise (MBE)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Penserra\u2019s designation as a minority-owned business enterprise (MBE) uniquely positions the firm to;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Provide active management for sustainable investing strategies<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Investment banking capabilities for corporations seeking minority inclusion<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trade execution services to institutional investors with diverse supplier mandates<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:46px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedgallery.kb-gallery-wrap-id-87_0fc99d-23{margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedgallery .kb-gallery-type-masonry.kb-gallery-id-87_0fc99d-23{margin:-10px;}.kb-gallery-type-masonry.kb-gallery-id-87_0fc99d-23 .kadence-blocks-gallery-item{padding:10px;}.kb-gallery-id-87_0fc99d-23 .kadence-blocks-gallery-item .kb-gal-image-radius, .kb-gallery-id-87_0fc99d-23 .kb-slide-item .kb-gal-image-radius img{border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;;}<\/style><div class=\"kb-gallery-wrap-id-87_0fc99d-23 alignnone wp-block-kadence-advancedgallery\"><ul class=\"kb-gallery-ul kb-gallery-non-static kb-gallery-type-masonry kb-masonry-init kb-gallery-id-87_0fc99d-23 kb-gallery-caption-style-bottom-hover kb-gallery-filter-grayscale\" data-image-filter=\"grayscale\" data-item-selector=\".kadence-blocks-gallery-item\" data-lightbox-caption=\"true\" data-columns-xxl=\"6\" data-columns-xl=\"6\" data-columns-md=\"4\" data-columns-sm=\"3\" data-columns-xs=\"3\" data-columns-ss=\"3\"><li class=\"kadence-blocks-gallery-item\"><div class=\"kadence-blocks-gallery-item-inner\"><figure class=\"kb-gallery-figure kadence-blocks-gallery-item-hide-caption\"><div class=\"kb-gal-image-radius\" style=\"max-width:452px;\"><div class=\"kb-gallery-image-contain kadence-blocks-gallery-intrinsic\" style=\"padding-bottom:24%;\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/ny-state-of-opportunity-minority-women-business.jpg\" width=\"452\" height=\"111\" alt=\"\" data-full-image=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/ny-state-of-opportunity-minority-women-business.jpg\" data-light-image=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/ny-state-of-opportunity-mi